READING:
 - consec: maxmult of differences GROWS (k-1, k-2, ...): MANY repeated diffs
   e_a-e_b=e_c-e_d  =>  support-4 (or support-2 commensurate) SHORT relations.
   This is the LDPC 'quasi-collision' of tolerance 1: t consecutive cols of the
   circulant C sum to a weight-2 vector. Minimal-distance relation code => corr LARGE.
 - Sidon/arc: maxmult = 1 (all differences distinct) => NO tolerance-1 collision
   => relation code has d>=3 (MDS-like, general position) => corr ~ iid (small).
READING:
 - consec: maxmult of differences GROWS (k-1, k-2, ...): MANY repeated diffs
   e_a-e_b=e_c-e_d  =>  support-4 (or support-2 commensurate) SHORT relations.
   This is the LDPC 'quasi-collision' of tolerance 1: t consecutive cols of the
   circulant C sum to a weight-2 vector. Minimal-distance relation code => corr LARGE.
 - Sidon/arc: maxmult = 1 (all differences distinct) => NO tolerance-1 collision
   => relation code has d>=3 (MDS-like, general position) => corr ~ iid (small).

